{
    "0": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That moon in the distance is looking..."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oddly strange."
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Overlord Alinsky? here?",
                "I thought I already scared you away."
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Weird Western Urban Legend",
                "Abbey Vanilla"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Me? Scared of you?"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I've scared away people by just hiding in the dark.",
                "Where other doubt what's in there."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Probably what's scaring everyone is your smell."
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Impossible-",
                "I Bath weekly and use vanilla soap."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Schwarze Mann...",
                "You clearly don't look like someone who even bathes."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways,",
                "What's your reason to be here?"
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm following that strange ass moon.",
                "Look at it!"
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That moon is fake.",
                "You're following a fake moon."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's fake?"
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now That I see closely...",
                "It looks very strange to be the real one."
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It was put there by a weirdo to make monsters feel good."
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And who's this weirdo?"
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No idea.",
                "It just appeared there."
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you sure you don't know this weirdo?"
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I don't!",
                "But...Since this moon is here."
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I may also use this \"moon\" for my advantage then."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh!?"
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can make all your nightmares come to reality.",
                "now that you're awake..."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Enjoy the illusions down the rabbit hole of your mind."

            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're one weird monster."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways, is there somewhere I need to go now?"
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just fly towards the fake moon.",
                "But it might take a while to get there!"
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't Worry.",
                "I'll immediately be there After the next splash screen shows up."
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A blood moon?, That's strange."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe it's a good time for some monster necromancy."
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Don't you think it is toooooo early for that?"
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Weird Western Urban Legend",
                "Abbey Vanilla"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Mmmmmmm Probably.",
                "What time is it?"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's like 2:00PM",
                "Shouldn't you wait until it's night-time?"
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh, but it's always night-time in halloween country",
                "Isn't it?"
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Until it's even darker then.",
                "That stuff scares most at late nights."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's scary and dark all the time in here!",
                "There won't be any difference."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oooooooooook",
                "Whatever you say, boss."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Plus don't worry. It won't be too many victims."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, I wonder if the blood moon could work for you.",
                "Could it?"
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh yeah! I was after that moon! I forgot."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It'll probably make necromantic powers stronger-",
                "Don't you think?"
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "true! Why don't you find out then?",
                "Like that you can view the land of horror! You necromaniac!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're really a yokai for these days."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You must enjoy october parties a lot."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So...",
                "You're still looking at the blood moon?"
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I am but...",
                "What the hell I'm supposed to go now..."
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "fly towards that weird sky hole over there!",
                "It's not actually a moon. Duh."
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Everyone seems aggresive tonight."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I should've stayed in home.",
                "People there are far more interesting being aggresive."
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Stayin' home?",
                "When the best October party is going on?"
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Western Urban Legend",
                "Abbey Vanilla"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This ain't an October party.",
                "everyone is being all stupid today."
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's a blood moon.",
                "The roar of the beasts is more powerful than ever."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Powerfully stupid."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm sure this blood moon also affects you cats."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It doesn't make us cats crazy.",
                "If anything, It makes us more intimidating."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait...",
                "Are you really not feeling crazy at all?"
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The weight of my breasts is making me crazy right now."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So, What's really your reason to be here?",
                "To be all grumpy?"
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey!"
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was just wandering around."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So just flyin' around I see.",
                "On Spooktown."
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yes, on spooktown. You may as well know about this blood moon.",
                "With all that weird talk."
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "you were \"just wandering around\".",
                "Why would you care?"
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe, huh",
                "Mind sharin' some info on all that?"
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If you survive your Illusionary past nightmares.",
                "Then, sure I can."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey! tell me!",
                "Dammit!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "21": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I feel the moon starting to affect me..."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So..."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Starting to feel \"stupid\" now?",
                "like you said?"
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ugh, just forget what I said before."
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Sorry.",
                "But fine, I'll tell ya."
            ]
        },
        "65_0": {
            "lines": [
                "See that moon over there? ",
                "It's sucking and attracting yokai to...who knows where."
            ]
        },
        "66_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What?",
                "Why didn't you do something about that?"
            ]
        },
        "67_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm an stage 3 boss.",
                "what do you expect me to do against THAT?"
            ]
        }
